### REST Client — S7.P Práctica MSIX (slides 4-15).
### Máquina de 8 pasos + check Publisher↔Cert + artefactos canónicos.

@host = http://localhost:5103

### Salud
GET {{host}}/health

### Listar los 8 pasos de la práctica (slide 15)
GET {{host}}/practica/pasos

### Info del paso 3 (configurar manifest, slide 6)
GET {{host}}/practica/paso?paso=ConfigurarManifest

### Avanzar paso 1 → paso 2 si todos los criterios pasan
POST {{host}}/practica/avanzar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pasoActual": "CrearSolucion", "criteriosOk": [true, true, true] }

### NO avanza si un criterio falla
POST {{host}}/practica/avanzar
Content-Type: application/json

{ "pasoActual": "ConfigurarManifest", "criteriosOk": [true, false, true, true] }

### Publisher coincide con Subject del cert (slide 7) → ok
POST {{host}}/practica/cert-coincide
Content-Type: application/json

{ "publisherManifest": "CN=MsixDemoCurso", "subjectCertificado": "CN=MsixDemoCurso" }

### Publisher NO coincide → Windows rechaza (error #1 slide 7)
POST {{host}}/practica/cert-coincide
Content-Type: application/json

{ "publisherManifest": "CN=MsixDemoCurso", "subjectCertificado": "CN=OtroCurso" }

### Cert sin EKU Code Signing → no firma código
POST {{host}}/practica/cert-uso
Content-Type: application/json

{ "ekus": ["1.3.6.1.5.5.7.3.1"] }

### Manifest canónico para comparar (slide 6)
GET {{host}}/practica/artefactos/manifest?empresa=Empresa&app=MsixDemo&version=1.0.0.0

### .appinstaller canónico para el reto (slide 11)
GET {{host}}/practica/artefactos/appinstaller?empresa=Empresa&app=MsixDemo&version=1.0.0.0&baseUri=https://stventasprod.blob.core.windows.net/msix

### Plan + checklist + artefactos completos (slide 15)
POST {{host}}/practica/plan
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "parametros": { "empresa": "Empresa", "app": "MsixDemo", "version": "1.0.0.0", "baseUri": "https://x/msix" },
  "subjectCertificado": "CN=Empresa"
}
